### Index page (HTML)
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Health check (JSON)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Existing room
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/1

### Missing room -> 404
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/2

### Invalid path parameter -> 400 (rejected by the Path extractor)
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/abc

### Unknown route -> 404 (no handler matched)
GET http://localhost:3000/unknown
